# This project builds and deploys with pnpm (see vercel.json + root build
# script + packageManager field). A committed npm package-lock.json only drifts
# from pnpm-lock.yaml and triggers ERR_PNPM_OUTDATED_LOCKFILE + merge conflicts.
# pnpm-lock.yaml is the ONE lockfile of record; keep npm's out of the repo.
package-lock.json
